Proton's ntsync_tmp.h is a copy of a Linux uapi header (<linux/types.h>);
only include it on Linux.  Without it the server-based fallback is used.

Also: SYSCALL_NARROW_ARG() for the narrow (BOOLEAN/WORD) syscall
arguments in this file; see patch-include_wine_unixlib_h.

